  <p class="meta-line">Ian Maurer · CTO, GenomOncology</p>
  <p>
    I am the CTO of GenomOncology. I write about AI agents doing real biomedical
    work.
  </p>
  <p>
    GenomOncology builds precision-oncology software: knowledge graphs, molecular
    reporting, trial matching, and decision support that runs on-premises. My
    current focus is connecting language models to trusted tools and curated
    data — and building the agent workflows that make that reliable enough for
    biomedical use.
